% Edges cite entries here by key from their `evidence` lists (ROADMAP M8;
% SPECIFICATION.md §8.2). The validator is the gate, as always: an evidence
% key with no entry fails the build, an entry cited by no edge is an
% info-level curation hint, and every entry needs at least a title and year.
%
% House rules (enforced; see CONTRIBUTING.md):
%   - keys are lowercase-kebab, author(s)-year: two authors "kak-slaney-1988",
%     three or more "west-etal-1997";
%   - a strict BibTeX subset: concrete entries only (no @string/@preamble),
%     values {braced}, "quoted", or bare numbers — no macros, no # concatenation;
%   - plain UTF-8 text, not TeX: write ö, é, and en-dashes (–) directly;
%   - authors in "Last, First and Last, First" form (the app reformats);
%   - cite a DOI or URL only when checked; a findable title/venue/year
%     beats a guessed link.
%
% Entries are grouped by the cluster that first demanded them; order is
% cosmetic (the build sorts by key).

